7#pullrequestreview-3706227261","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115387","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115387#pullrequestreview-3706227261"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115387"}},"submitted_at":"2026-01-26T14:13:03Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3893390179,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7oEGtj","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally (rebased on top of `master` https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/c53c5a1f49fa1edf97e6b570297c90a57d30a558), it works as expected.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_pr_115387.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25756407/test_pr_115387.zip)\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2535\" height=\"279\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c33a998c-76f2-4e3e-b96c-274efe3b8386\" />\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- Functionality-wise, I think this is pretty solid. It's not too much extra code either compared to the added functionality this brings. This also makes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115394 significantly more useful outside of custom shaders.\r\n\r\n- I get error spam when specifying a texture in a new StyleBoxFlat if none of the corners are rounded:\r\n\r\n```\r\n  ERROR: Vertex amount (8) must be a multiple of the amount of vertices required by the render primitive (3).\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe texture is still visible though. The errors stop being printed as soon as you increase any of the corner radii to 1, or turn off **Draw Center**.\r\n\r\n- There are artifacts if you have a border texture with **Blend** enabled, but **Draw Center** is disabled, or a translucent color is used for the center:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1229\" height=\"340\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/71138c3a-3f50-48b7-9d4f-a9201dd47930\" />\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f5c71ed-a7c3-47c0-8ed2-e3e31b2fcfa2\r\n\r\n- Artifacts are also visible with all corner radii set to 0 when the border texture is transparent, even if the center has no texture:\r\n\r\nAll corner radii = 0 | One corner radii = 1\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"798\" height=\"246\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/53238031-69fe-4733-9cd9-832de40d7b6a\" /> | <img width=\"798\" height=\"246\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e3b09fef-4816-4d9e-806d-62a3b836b843\" />\r\n\r\n- Corner detail seems to mismatch with the border and center, which causes artifacts to be \r\nvisible, especially at lower corner details:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/973db967-daf5-45f7-8c38-3c461dedfc02\r\n\r\nThis is the cause of the artifacts near the edges on the first example at the top in the testing project.\r\n\r\n- StyleBoxes that have a shadow enabled and a texture but no border display artifacts on the shadow:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"205\" height=\"105\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5a75bfea-e782-4a0e-bdcd-8f7109440b4c\" />\r\n\r\n(The artifacts are tinted according to the border texture, if one is specified.)","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115387#pullrequestreview-3893390179","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115387","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115387#pullrequestreview-3893390179"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115387"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-05T03:22:13Z","commit_id":"2e0fd930dd1374f2dcfaff060162e3c9c679b03d"},{"id":3900027308,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7odbGs","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Works great now :slightly_smiling_face: Code looks good to me.\n\n<img width=\"583\" height=\"200\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9ea4c10a-781d-4f27-b961-28a3d703f84e\" /> | <img width=\"583\" height=\"200\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/346ded93-764b-42b2-9460-7c80652f00b7\" /> | <img width=\"583